 "id": "strings",
 "order": 16,
 "name": "Vlvt: string machine",
 "description": [
  "8th machine \"Vlvt\": a string ensemble in the style of a Solina (idea: string-machine by jpcima after Peter Whiting;",
  "own code). SHAPE = chord (the CHORD list; 0 = mono, 1 / 2 = unison 2 / 4), COLOR = 8' / 4' mix, SWEEP = tone,",
  "CONTOUR = ensemble, DECAY / FUNC + DECAY = decay / attack, GATE = hold while the trig / note lasts (like CHORD).",
  "With patch 06: strum per chord note.",
  "Needs Grit (patch 15)."
 ],
